<title>POLAND: Clinton arrives in Poland after Madrid NATO summit.</title>
<headline>Clinton arrives in Poland after Madrid NATO summit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton arrived in Poland on Thursday from Spain where a NATO summit in Madrid invited Poland, the Czech Republic and Hungary to talks on joining the Western alliance.</p>
<p>Polish public television showed Clinton's Air Force One jet landing at Warsaw's airport at 1.05 p.m. (1105 GMT).</p>
